# ShopService: an ordinary CAP service (OData V4) that uses the three SOAP services in-process.

@server = http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/shop
@auth = Basic alice:alice


### Products (srv.run on ProductCatalog, with SELECT.__skipPagination: all 8 products that are not discontinued, not
### a page of 4), stock (one soap.read with the product list: one GetStock
### call per product), the EUR->USD rate (soap.read on ExchangeRates) and country names
### (the CountryCodes mock), combined
GET {{server}}/Offers?$filter=Category eq 'Furniture'&$orderby=PriceUSD desc&$count=true
Authorization: {{auth}}

###
GET {{server}}/Offers?$top=3
Authorization: {{auth}}

### soap.createRequest: a request of its own, dispatched to ProductCatalog's Stock
GET {{server}}/stockOf(ProductID='P004')
Authorization: {{auth}}

### No stock: 404 from the handler
GET {{server}}/stockOf(ProductID='P999')
Authorization: {{auth}}

### soap.read on ExchangeRates
GET {{server}}/convert(Amount=100,From='EUR',To='GBP')
Authorization: {{auth}}

### No rate: 404 from the handler
GET {{server}}/convert(Amount=100,From='JPY',To='EUR')
Authorization: {{auth}}

### The utility API: isSoapService, getEntityKeyFields, FORBIDDEN_SOAP_HEADERS, stripSensitiveHeaders, dedupByKeys
GET {{server}}/soapInfo()
Authorization: {{auth}}
